document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910733011:1":{"text":"북소리가... 그 어느 때보다 선명해. 선율이, 선율이 들려...!","source_cn":"鼓声……比以往任何时候都要清晰。韵律，我听见韵律……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4722DEFAE8A5A733","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910733012:1":{"text":"네 이름이다, 엘피라. 천해족의 딸...! 네 촉수가 얼마나 연약한지, 네 피와 살이 심해에서 얼마나 따뜻한지 그 소리가 내게 알려 주고 있다고!","source_cn":"那是你的名字，艾菲拉，浅海裔的女儿……！它在告诉我，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5FE1AC920116DF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910733013:1":{"text":"너는 혼자여선 안 돼. 누구도... 혼자여선 안 돼...","source_cn":"你，不能一个人，谁都不能……孤身一人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32B9EA258A89CBA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910733014:1":{"text":"그저... 살짝... 찢기만 하면... 충분하니까...!","source_cn":"只要……轻轻……一撕……就可以……满足……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF51FF7A81FAB53A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910733015:1":{"text":"...아니, 안 돼. 나는 아직...!","source_cn":"……不，不。我还能——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76461B98E13EE3FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti